       "full_text": "#DiriyahCompany unveils the #DiriyahCorinthia Residences project, featuring authentic Najdi-style residences.\nThis exclusive development creates a harmonious living experience that celebrates the charm of #TheCityOfEarth.\n\nhttps://t.co/D2ep28ztxJ https://t.co/02IyjCwdHR",
