       "full_text": "#DiriyahCompany partners with one of the world's finest brands for the #BaccaratDiriyahResidences the latest addition to its visionary masterplan to create an exceptional lifestyle in #Diriyah #TheCityofEarth.\n\nLearn more:\nhttps://t.co/ZVbcuMa9pA https://t.co/UVt8d3ath4",
